# Work Context Reliability Verification Chain

## 1. Overall Reliability Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Entry"
        WC[work-context<br/>file-path]
    end

    subgraph "Data Collection"
        Collect[Gather 4 Streams<br/>docs, deps, tests, usage]
    end

    subgraph "Reliability Scoring"
        R1[📚 Docs Reliability<br/>30% weight]
        R2[🔗 Deps Reliability<br/>30% weight]
        R3[🧪 Tests Reliability<br/>20% weight]
        R4[⚠️  Impact Reliability<br/>20% weight]
    end

    subgraph "Aggregation"
        Score[Total Score<br/>weighted average]
        Grade[Grade<br/>A/B/C/D/F]
    end

    subgraph "Output"
        Display[Display Context<br/>+ Reliability Info]
        Suggest[Improvement<br/>Suggestions]
    end

    WC -->|1. execute| Collect
    Collect -->|2. verify| R1
    Collect -->|3. verify| R2
    Collect -->|4. verify| R3
    Collect -->|5. verify| R4

    R1 -->|30%| Score
    R2 -->|30%| Score
    R3 -->|20%| Score
    R4 -->|20%| Score

    Score -->|classify| Grade
    Grade -->|pass| Display
    Grade -->|analyze| Suggest

