## 2. Document Reliability Chain (30% weight)

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Input"
        DocRefs[@doc tags<br/>from file]
    end

    subgraph "Verification Steps"
        V1[1. File Exists<br/>managed/**/]
        V2[2. H1 Match<br/># [[Symbol]]]
        V3[3. validate-docs<br/>check syntax]
        V4[4. check-links<br/>validate links]
        V5[5. validate-spec<br/>completeness score]
    end

    subgraph "Scoring"
        S1[Base: 100%<br/>if file exists]
        S2[-10%<br/>if H1 mismatch]
        S3[-20%<br/>if broken links]
        S4[-30%<br/>if spec < 70%]
        Final1[Final Score<br/>0-100%]
    end

    subgraph "Grade"
        G1{Score?}
        Pass[✅ 100%<br/>Excellent]
        Warn[⚠️  50-99%<br/>Issues Found]
        Fail[❌ 0%<br/>Not Found]
    end

    DocRefs -->|search| V1
    V1 -->|found| V2
    V2 -->|pass| V3
    V3 -->|pass| V4
    V4 -->|pass| V5

    V1 -->|result| S1
    V2 -->|penalty| S2
    V4 -->|penalty| S3
    V5 -->|penalty| S4
    S1 -->|combine| Final1
    S2 -->|combine| Final1
    S3 -->|combine| Final1
    S4 -->|combine| Final1

    Final1 -->|check| G1
    G1 -->|100| Pass
    G1 -->|50-99| Warn
    G1 -->|0| Fail

    classDef input fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#0277bd
    classDef verify fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17
