## 6. Total Reliability Calculation

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Individual Scores"
        R1[📚 Docs<br/>Score: X%<br/>Weight: 30%]
        R2[🔗 Deps<br/>Score: Y%<br/>Weight: 30%]
        R3[🧪 Tests<br/>Score: Z%<br/>Weight: 20%]
        R4[⚠️  Impact<br/>Score: W%<br/>Weight: 20%]
    end

    subgraph "Calculation"
        Calc[Total = X×0.3 + Y×0.3<br/>+ Z×0.2 + W×0.2]
    end

    subgraph "Grading"
        Grade{Total?}
        A[✅ A: 90-100%<br/>Excellent]
        B[🟢 B: 70-89%<br/>Good]
        C[🟡 C: 50-69%<br/>Fair]
        D[🔴 D: 0-49%<br/>Poor]
    end

    subgraph "Action Items"
        Improve[Generate<br/>Improvement Suggestions]
        I1[Fix missing docs]
        I2[Rebuild database]
        I3[Add tests]
        I4[Update dependencies]
    end

    R1 -->|30%| Calc
    R2 -->|30%| Calc
    R3 -->|20%| Calc
    R4 -->|20%| Calc

    Calc -->|classify| Grade
    Grade -->|90-100| A
    Grade -->|70-89| B
    Grade -->|50-69| C
    Grade -->|0-49| D

    A & B & C & D -->|analyze| Improve
    Improve -->|prioritize| I1
    Improve -->|prioritize| I2
    Improve -->|prioritize| I3
    Improve -->|prioritize| I4

    classDef input fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#0277bd
    classDef calc fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17
    classDef grade fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef action fill:#ffccbc,stroke:#d84315

    class R1,R2,R3,R4 input
    class Calc calc
    class Grade,A,B,C,D grade
    class Improve,I1,I2,I3,I4 action
```

## 7. Improvement Feedback Loop

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Detection"
        WC[work-context<br/>execution]
        Low[Low Score<br/>< 70%]
    end

    subgraph "Analysis"
        Analyze{Which<br/>Section?}
        AD[Docs Issue]
        AE[Deps Issue]
        AT[Tests Issue]
        AI[Impact Issue]
    end

    subgraph "Suggestions"
        SD[Run: validate-docs<br/>Create: managed/**.md]
        SE[Run: build src<br/>Fix: cycles]
        ST[Run: untested<br/>Create: __tests__/**]
        SI[Run: build src<br/>Update: database]
    end

    subgraph "Action"
        Execute[Execute Fix]
    end

    subgraph "Verification"
        Verify[Re-run<br/>work-context]
        Check[Score Improved?]
    end

    WC -->|score| Low
    Low -->|analyze| Analyze
    Analyze -->|docs < 50%| AD
    Analyze -->|deps < 70%| AE
    Analyze -->|tests = 0%| AT
    Analyze -->|impact < 70%| AI

    AD -->|suggest| SD
    AE -->|suggest| SE
    AT -->|suggest| ST
    AI -->|suggest| SI

    SD -->|fix| Execute
    SE -->|fix| Execute
    ST -->|fix| Execute
    SI -->|fix| Execute

    Execute -->|re-run| Verify
    Verify -->|check| Check
    Check -->|yes ✅| WC
    Check -->|no ❌| Analyze

    classDef detect fill:#e1bee7,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef analyze fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef suggest fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px
    classDef action fill:#c5e1a5,stroke:#558b2f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef verify fill:#ffccbc,stroke:#d84315,stroke-width:2px

    class WC,Low detect
    class Analyze,AD,AE,AT,AI analyze
    class SD,SE,ST,SI suggest
    class Execute action
    class Verify,Check verify
```

